This repository is derived from pollen-robotics/microduck_rl. Its public
history begins with a curated release snapshot; subsequent development uses
ordinary commits. The upstream project and MicroDuck robot assets are
copyright their respective contributors and are used under their published
licenses.

The swing-seat generator, retention components, and experiment-specific
training/evaluation additions were developed for this playground repository.

The MicroDock charging-dock generator, printable meshes, docking simulation
and render scripts were developed for this playground repository. The dock's
tag uses the tag36h11 code word for ID 0 from the AprilTag library (BSD
2-Clause).

